---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="About — Luca Wetherall"
  description="Learn more about Luca Wetherall, a musician, composer, and teacher based in London."
>
  <h1>About</h1>
  <div class="about-content">
    <p>
      Luca Wetherall is a versatile musician, composer, and teacher based in London.
      With a deep passion for music spanning classical, contemporary, and sacred traditions,
      Luca brings a wealth of experience to every performance and collaboration.
    </p>
    <p>
      Holding degrees in music performance and composition, Luca has developed a distinctive
      artistic voice that bridges historical practice with modern expression. This breadth
      of training informs both performance and creative work, allowing for thoughtful
      interpretations that honour tradition while embracing innovation.
    </p>
    <p>
      As a performer, Luca has worked with ensembles and churches across London, contributing
      to a vibrant musical community. Notable collaborations include work with St. Mary's Acton,
      the Alma Consort, and St. John the Baptist Holland Road, among others.
    </p>
    <p>
      Beyond performance, Luca is a dedicated educator, committed to nurturing the next
      generation of musicians. With experience teaching across a range of abilities and ages,
      Luca's approach emphasises musical understanding, technical development, and the joy of
      making music.
    </p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>

<style>
  h1 {
    margin-bottom: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem);
  }

  .about-content p {
    margin-bottom: 1.25em;
  }

  .about-content p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }
</style>
